@prefix sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .

<https://w3c.github.io/sdw-sosa-ssn/ssn/rdf/examples/moreSpecificTemperatureSensorOperatingRange> a sosa:ObservationCollection ;
    sosa:hasMember <https://w3c.github.io/sdw-sosa-ssn/ssn/rdf/examples/moreSpecificHumidityCondition>,
        <https://w3c.github.io/sdw-sosa-ssn/ssn/rdf/examples/moreSpecificTemperatureCondition> ;
    sosa:observedProperty <https://example.org/closure/ex7-humidity>,
        <https://example.org/closure/ex7-temperature> .

